				2 Fault
				3 Pre-Fail
				4 Partially Broken
				5 Degraded
				6 Bad Sectors Found
				7 Bit Errors Found
				8 Consistent
				9 Inconsistent
				10 Busy
				11 No Input
				12 Low Battery
				13 Single Link Fault
				14 Invalid
				15 Write Protect
				16 single link
				17 No Redundant Link
				18 Offline"
			::= { hwInfoLunEntry 9 }

		
