				76: Migrated
				77: Activating
				78: Deactivating
				79: Start failed
				80: Stop failed
				81: Decommissioning
				82: Decommissioned
				83: Recommissioning
				84: Replacing node
				85: Scheduling
				86: Pausing
				87: Suspending
				88: Suspended
				89: Overload
				90: To be switch
				91: Switching
